<title>BRAZIL: Spain's Iberdrola in winning group of Rio gas sale.</title>
<headline>Spain's Iberdrola in winning group of Rio gas sale.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish group Iberdrola Investimentos Sociedade Unipessoal LDA is also a member of the winning consortium of today's auction of Rio state gas firms Companhia Estadual de Gas (CEG) and Riogas, the Rio bolsa said.</p>
<p>The group also includes Gas Natural SDG SA, U.S. firm Enron Corp and Argentine Pluspetrol Energy SA.</p>
<p>CEG and Riogas were sold for 622.2 million reais, 74.8 percent above the combined base price of 355.8 million reais.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom 5521 5074151))</p>
